SUMMARY:Wimpole Estate: Christmas at Wimpole
LOCATION:Wimpole Estate\, Arrington\, Royston SG8 0BW
DESCRIPTION:National Trust\, ~25 min drive. Illuminated trail through the gardens\, opening night\, runs 20 Nov-3 Jan. Adult off-peak £18 / standard £26\, child off-peak £13 / peak £19.50\, £1 for under-3s\, free for NT members\, parking £8. https://www.nationaltrust.org.uk/visit/cambridgeshire/wimpole-estate/christmas-at-wimpole
END:VEVENT
